# ===== 拷贝到项目根目录后，把文件名改成 .gitignore =====

### Java / Maven ###
target/
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

### IDE ###
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo
*~

### 日志 ###
logs/
*.log
log/

### 环境变量与密钥（**最重要，绝不能提交**）###
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
application-local.yml
application-prod.yml

### 前端 ###
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
*.local
.eslintcache
unpackage/
miniprogram_npm/

### 微信小程序 ###
project.private.config.json
project.private.config.*.json

### 操作系统 ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### 构建与部署产物 ###
*.tar
*.tar.gz
/data/
/mysql-data/
/redis-data/
/minio-data/
